  "capture_note": "Frozen r1-a HTTP response baseline anchored to pre-ResponsePolicy commit 2ac98add366afa3324f92652423d4d7011a795bd. Exact response bytes, status, and Content-Type are recorded for valid-request outcomes, composite claims, and 422 validation responses. The /v1/verify route does not invoke claim_pipeline/scope_classifier; abstain/out_of_scope is not reachable through valid requests (empty claims fail schema validation with 422), and abstain/processing_error is not emitted by this route. known_defects records three currently reproducible invalid-input paths that raise 500; they are documented here without fixing them in this baseline-only PR.",
